@baseUrl = http://localhost:5244
@email = cosmetics.student@example.test
@password = Development123!
@skinId = 60000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
@mascotId = 70000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
@purchaseRequestId = e2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### Obtain CSRF; Rider preserves cookies.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/csrf

> {% client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body.token); %}

### Run once, or use an existing account and skip registration.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}","displayName":"Студент"}

### Login, then refresh CSRF.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Refresh after login.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/csrf

> {% client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body.token); %}

### Store catalog; coins must be earned in an existing trial before purchase.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shop/skins

### First purchase; replay this exact request to verify no second debit.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shop/skins/{{skinId}}/purchase
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{"requestId":"{{purchaseRequestId}}"}

### Inventory.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/skins

### Equip an owned skin. This does not edit the frontend or change AvatarKey.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/me/skin
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{"skinId":"{{skinId}}"}

### Mascot catalog.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mascots

### Reaction definitions.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mascots/{{mascotId}}

### Choose a mascot for future attempts.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/me/mascot
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{"mascotId":"{{mascotId}}"}

### Appearance and profile.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/appearance

### Existing profile fields plus characterSkin and mascot.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me

### Private receipts.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/purchases?page=1
